body:
I was successful debugging in VS Code using the following launch configuration:

```
{
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "configurations": [
        {
            "type": "node",
            "request": "launch",
            "name": "Launch Program",
            "skipFiles": [
                "<node_internals>/**"
            ],
            "program": "${workspaceFolder}/node_modules/next/dist/bin/next",
            "runtimeArgs": [
                "--inspect"
            ]
        }
    ]
}
```
